# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# NOTE — do NOT add rules like "/hakkimizda  /hakkimizda.html  301".
# Cloudflare Pages already serves hakkimizda.html at /hakkimizda and issues its own
# 308 from /hakkimizda.html -> /hakkimizda. A rule in the opposite direction would
# create an infinite redirect loop.
#
# Canonical URLs across the site are therefore the extension-less form
# (https://brams-tr.com/hakkimizda), matching what Pages actually serves.
#
# This file is kept for future use — e.g. retiring or renaming a page:
#
#   /eski-sayfa        /cozumler        301
#   /en/old-page       /en/solutions    301
